<!--
    Turtle Launcher Color System — Light theme
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    Full design-token palette for the LIGHT appearance. The dark theme lives in
    values-night/colors_night.xml (the launcher's default). Both files define the
    exact same name set so every layout/drawable/code reference resolves in either
    appearance without resource fallback surprises.

    Tokens are grouped by the Turtle design system:
      Surfaces      main #F1F3F0 · secondary #E8ECE8 · surface #FFFFFF
                    surface-2 #F7F8F6 · surface-3 #ECEFEC
      Primary       #348C49 (hover #2F7E42 · pressed #286D39 · soft #DDEFE1)
      Emerald       #348C49 ramp  · Diamond/tech #278D9E · Gold #B98220
      Semantic      success #348C49 · warning #A96D24 · error #C83F3F · info #317EBA
      Text          primary #171B18 · secondary #56605A · tertiary #737D76 · disabled #A3AAA5
      Borders       #D3D9D4 · strong #BCC5BE · focus #348C49 · error #C83F3F

    Alpha is reserved for functional layers only: touch ripples, scrims/overlays and
    shadows. No surface/panel/top-bar uses transparency (no glassmorphism).
-->
